---
---

<section id="come-funziona" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200/60 text-[#FF6B00] text-xs font-bold mb-6">
        Funzionalità Chiave
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
        Tutto quello che serve <br />
        <span class="text-[#FF6B00]">
          per incassare ed emettere.
        </span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">

      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-zinc-950 rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 text-white flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden border border-zinc-900 min-h-[580px] relative">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF6B00]">Zero Hardware</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-2 leading-tight">
            La cassa completa nel tuo palmo
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="relative -mb-16 mt-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-4 text-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 shadow-md">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-zinc-100">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Cassa Attiva</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-black text-zinc-900">Postazione #1</p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
                AdE Online
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 text-white border border-zinc-800">
              <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 uppercase font-semibold">Incasso Giornaliero</p>
              <p class="text-2xl font-black mt-1">€ 1.482,50</p>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-3 text-[10px] text-zinc-400">
                <span>34 scontrini</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">+18% vs ieri</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-4 text-xs font-bold">
              <button class="py-2.5 px-3 bg-orange-50 text-[#FF6B00] rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-100 transition-colors">
                + Nuovo Incasso
              </button>
              <button class="py-2.5 px-3 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors">
                Chiusura / Report
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-zinc-200/80 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 stroke-current" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-center">
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-400 font-medium">Scontrino #048-2026</span>
            <div class="text-3xl font-black text-zinc-900 mt-1">€ 75,00</div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-zinc-500">
              <span>Cliente</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-800">Marco Rossi (WhatsApp)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-zinc-500">
              <span>Metodo Pagamento</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-[#FF6B00] flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B00]"></span> POS / Carta
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-zinc-500">
              <span>Protocollo AdE</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-medium text-zinc-700">DCO-99824-OK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
            Invio istantaneo e 100% a norma
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Nessuna operazione complessa di fine giornata. Digiscon si interfaccia direttamente con i servizi telematici dell'Agenzia delle Entrate all'atto dell'incasso.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-[2.5rem] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between flex-1">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-zinc-400">Zero Carta</p>
              <h4 class="text-base font-extrabold text-zinc-900 mt-1">QR Code & WhatsApp</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 text-[#FF6B00]">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M3 3h8v8H3V3zm2 2v4h4V5H5zm8-2h8v8h-8V3zm2 2v4h4V5h-4zM3 13h8v8H3v-8zm2 2v4h4v-4H5zm13-2h3v2h-3v-2zm-3 2h2v3h-2v-3zm3 3h3v3h-3v-3zm-5 1h2v2h-2v-2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-600">
            Mostra il QR per scaricare il PDF fiscale in un istante o invialo direttamente in chat.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200/70 rounded-[2.5rem] p-6 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-[#FF6B00]">Accesso Rapido</p>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-zinc-900 mt-0.5">Smartphone e Tablet</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B00] text-white flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mt-6 items-stretch">
      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-zinc-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 text-white flex flex-col justify-between border border-zinc-800">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF6B00]">Massima Libertà</span>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mt-1">Collega qualsiasi POS</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-2">
            Compatibile con SumUp, Nexi, contanti o bonifico. Se il cliente vuole la ricevuta fisica, stampi via Bluetooth.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-zinc-800 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B00]"></span>
          Per ambulanti e negozi fisici
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">Statistiche Live</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
            +32% Questo mese
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-end justify-between h-24 gap-2 mt-4 px-2">
          <div class="w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-t-lg h-[40%]"></div>
          <div class="w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-t-lg h-[60%]"></div>
          <div class="w-full bg-zinc-300 rounded-t-lg h-[50%]"></div>
          <div class="w-full bg-orange-200 rounded-t-lg h-[75%]"></div>
          <div class="w-full bg-[#FF6B00] rounded-t-lg h-[95%]"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-zinc-400 mt-2 font-medium px-1">
          <span>Lun</span><span>Mar</span><span>Mer</span><span>Gio</span><span class="text-[#FF6B00] font-bold">Oggi</span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Monitora gli incassi per reparto o metodo di pagamento in tempo reale dal cruscotto.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF6B00]">Integrazione</span>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 mt-1">Negozio Easy</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Ti serve il magazzino e il barcode? Collega Digiscon al gestionale Negozio Easy in un click.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-zinc-200">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-800">Sincronizzazione automatica</span>
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>